stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Enabled
  Enabled --> Enabled: verified success / reset failures
  Enabled --> Suspended: terminal failure threshold
  Suspended --> Suspended: future evaluation denied
  Suspended --> Enabled: explicit operator resume / new epoch
  Enabled --> Recovery: expired lease reconciliation
  Recovery --> Enabled: same binding reclaimed
  Recovery --> Suspended: recovery/rollback failure
